{"title":"Physics forums","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Physics forums</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Online_forum&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Online forum (page does not exist)\"> online forums</a> that are great places to ask questions about physics, practice teaching physics, and to socialize with other physics students.  Here are a few popular online physics forums.  \n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c164_physics\">Physics Forum</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c193726_physics_olympiad_training\">Physics Olympiad Training</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.physicsforums.com/\">Physics Forums</a> is one of the most popular science forums on the internet.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_forums&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academics_forums\" title=\"Academics forums\">Academics forums</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Social_software&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Social software (page does not exist)\">Social software</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192506\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6/1000000\nPost‐expand 